# You normally do NOT need this file for API connectivity. Development and
# installed builds both default to PubMark's deployed Supabase Edge API.
# Set this only to deliberately use another compatible API, such as a local
# server during backend development.

# The app defaults to PubMark's deployed Supabase Edge API. Set this only to
# deliberately target another compatible API deployment.
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL=https://mkdkcrjtndqguambmduh.supabase.co/functions/v1/api

# "Sign in with Google" — required only in a dev-client/production build
# (the native library needs compiled-in native code, so this cannot work in
# plain Expo Go). Leave both blank to keep the feature disabled/hidden.
#
# EXPO_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_WEB_CLIENT_ID must be the exact same value as
# GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID in server/.env and VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID in the root
# .env.local — it's the Web-application OAuth client the server already
# verifies tokens against. EXPO_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_IOS_CLIENT_ID is a separate
# iOS-type client, only needed for iOS builds.
# EXPO_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_WEB_CLIENT_ID=
# EXPO_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_IOS_CLIENT_ID=
